  "description": "– Spacious Two Bedroom Apartment\n\n– Adjacent To Luas Station\n\n– Balcony\n\n– Secure Parking\n\n– Electric Central Heating\n\nVery well presented 2 bedroom apartment conveniently located close to the IFSC, 3 Arena and Conference Centre, Luas, shops, restaurants and bars.\n\nRecently redecorated, the accommodation comprises spacious open plan living/dining and fully fitted integrated kitchen. There are double glass doors leading to the balcony which overlooks landscaped central courtyard. Two double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and bathroom with bath and shower facilities. Electric central hearing. Secure Parking for 1 car. LEASE…From 1 year.",
